note seed/node/code-main.om -- omnode-code, the coding workflow program:
note omnode-code INFER TOOL OMC ROOT WORK JDIR PORT OBJ [OBJ...]
note with 1..4 objectives "KIND,K,N,A,PATH,TASK" and absolute paths (see
note seed/node/code.om). One hour for the whole run.
fn main to int
ret cw_main 1 3600
end
